        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International BP-7818, Traditional Cabinet Pull Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBackplates like this one are great for adding a little something more to any kitchen cabinet, dresser drawer, or bathroom vanity. They can be used to cover old screw holes. This Arched Cabinet Pull Backplate can be used with almost any cabinet pull with a 3 inch center to center. It is available in 9 finishes, so you will be sure to find the perfect one.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International BP-7818, Smooth Pull Backplates:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-NE10HE1_size.gif?v=1704354721\" width=\"567\" height=\"106\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
